<title>USA: Chesapeake Energy sets initial dividend.</title>
<headline>Chesapeake Energy sets initial dividend.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chesapeake Energy Corp said Thursday it had set the first quarterly cash dividend on its common stock at the rate of $0.02 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable July 15, record June 30.</p>
</text>
